<title>USA: Cardinal unit production &quot;behind plan&quot;.</title>
<headline>Cardinal unit production &quot;behind plan&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN, Ohio 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cardinal Health Inc said on Tuesday that production and installation of some new products of its Pyxis unit has been behind plan.</p>
<p>This backlog is anticipated to clear within the next few quarters, after which the unit's revenues and earnings should improve significantly, the company said.</p>
<p>Cardinal Health reported third-quarter net income per share of $0.33, or $0.58 excluding charges, compared with $0.46 for the same period in 1996.</p>
</text>
